/[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*
/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*
ExportedObj/
.consulo/
sysinfo.txt
InitTestScene*.unity*
*.mdb
*.pdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db

# Generated C# project files (Unity regenerates them from the .asmdef files)
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj

